[h2]3D Icons[/h2]
Draws in-world symbols above infantry, vehicles and operated drones. Icons shrink with distance. Names and some labels disappear as the icon gets smaller.

The server can choose which sides are visible in play and while spectating, whether to draw units in spectator mode, whether to show names, and whether to hide units behind objects. For group icons there are separate settings for visibility behind cover and for distance limits. Players can hide the overlay in the Client tab.

[h2]How to enable it[/h2]
In Eden, place the [b]3D Icons[/b] module to use it in that scenario. Enable it without an Eden module through [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=450814997]CBA_A3[/url]. Open [b]Addon Options → 3D Icons[/b], check [b]Enable 3D Icons[/b] and restart the mission. In multiplayer, use the Server tab.

